.TH std::multiset::~multiset 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::multiset::~multiset \- std::multiset::~multiset

.SH Synopsis
~multiset();

A destructor. Destructs the multiset. The destructors of the elements are called and the
used storage is deallocated. Note, that if the elements are pointers, the pointed-to
objects are not destroyed.

.SH Complexity

Linear in the size of the multiset.
